  "snp2.2:0.2": "<p><i>According to SnA, this poem is a dialogue between a brahman ascetic, Tissa, and the previous Buddha, Kassapa, who—unlike “our” Buddha, Gotama—was born into the brahman caste.</i></p><p>See also: MN 55</p>",
